# The Driftveil Drawbridge (the long bridge over the bay, wind and gulls and the lorries' hum): a wide flute melody in D
# over held strings, a rolling harp, a slow bass and a sparse beat, a crossing taken at a walk. Original composition for
# this game (plan 22 · U6, part d).
